msgctxt "132"
msgid "Is there a guy by the name of Gohren here?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "144"
msgid "Who are you?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "156"
msgid "I'm with the Honest Living Association. I'm here to see Gohren."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "168"
msgid "The HLA?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "180"
msgid "You dumbass. If you had just waited, we woulda come to you."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "192"
msgid "Look, I don't have time for flunkies like you. Bring Gohren out, right now."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "204"
msgid "Hey! Who you calling flunkies, pops!?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "216"
msgid ""
"Enjoy your ignorance while you can. Gohren-san only surrounds himself with "
"the toughest badasses around."
msgstr ""

msgctxt "228"
msgid "And that includes us!"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "240"
msgid ""
"I couldn't care less who you punks think you are. Are you gonna let me "
"past, or not?"
msgstr ""

msgctxt "252"
msgid "Enough of this bullshit! If you think you can get by us, go ahead and try!"
msgstr ""

